# S06-T07: ROOT LLM Agent

## Objective

Implement `root.llm.ts`: `proposeEpics` via LLM using whole-chat + project context (S05 invariant §2).

## App-agent preflight (MANDATORY before code)

- [ ] Run MCP preflight per `APP-AGENT-PROTOCOL.md` §2 — **warn user if :3000 down**
- [ ] `explain("work-control")` + `explain("integrations")`
- [ ] Read `apps/work-control/docs/llm-agents.md` (T06)
- [ ] Read `server/agents/root.mock.ts` for contract + reconcile-by-title behavior

## Implementation (app-agent conventions)

- [ ] Code under `apps/work-control/server/agents/llm/root.llm.ts`
- [ ] `defineFeatureHandler("work-control")` on routes unchanged; SEE on new files
- [ ] Output: `EpicProposal[]` with title + summary; full list re-derive (not append-only)
- [ ] Fallback to `root.mock.ts` when integrations not configured
- [ ] Wire through existing `propose.ts` factory hook (T10 may finalize registry)

## Done when (app-agent)

- [ ] `bun run test` — add/update unit test for fallback + mocked LLM path
- [ ] `scripts/smoke-agents.ts` or equivalent passes with mock; LLM path manual note if no key
- [ ] `feature:health` green

## Out

`server/agents/llm/root.llm.ts`, tests, factory partial wiring
